# BetterRoxas — build-time configuration template
#
# Copy to .env and adjust before running `npm run build` or `npm run package`.
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is git-ignored and is NEVER copied into dist/ or into the release
# archive — these values are consumed while building, not served to browsers.
# There are no server-side secrets in this project: the site is fully static,
# so anything that reaches the browser is public by definition. Do not put
# credentials here expecting them to stay private.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Canonical site URL
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by the React app build (react-app/next.config.js) for absolute URLs.
# No trailing slash. Change this for a staging subdomain deploy.
SITE_URL=https://betterroxas.vercel.app


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Placeholders — these MUST be replaced before the site goes public
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are embedded directly in the HTML rather than injected at build time,
# because the site ships as plain static pages with no templating step. The
# Roxas City rebrand left each one as a deliberate placeholder: the Solano
# values were removed, and no verified Roxas City equivalent was available.
#
#   Google Analytics measurement ID .... G-XXXXXXXXXX
#     Appears in the <head> of index.html, 403.html, 404.html, 500.html and
#     every page under services/ and service-details/.
#     Find with:  grep -rl "G-XXXXXXXXXX" --include="*.html" .
#     Until it is set to a real Roxas City property, gtag loads but records
#     nothing. Leaving it is safe; setting it to someone else's ID is not.
#
#   Facebook page ...... facebook.com/OfficialLguRoxasCityFanpage
#     PLACEHOLDER — this page slug was never verified to exist. It is linked
#     from every footer and embedded as an iframe on the homepage, so both the
#     link and the feed widget will be broken until it points at the real
#     Roxas City page.
#     Find with:  grep -rl "OfficialLguRoxasCityFanpage" .
#     The FB_PAGE_ID repo variable used by .github/workflows/facebook-sync.yml
#     needs the matching page ID.
#
#   Quiz site .......... quiz.betterroxas.org
#     PLACEHOLDER — no such deployment exists. Linked from the homepage CTA
#     and every footer. Either stand up the quiz or remove those links.
#     Find with:  grep -rl "quiz.betterroxas.org" .
#
#   Appointment system . roxasmayorsoffice-oasys.com
#     PLACEHOLDER — the Solano site linked a real third-party OASYS booking
#     system. No Roxas City equivalent is known, so this hostname does not
#     resolve. It is the primary CTA in the homepage appointment section.
#     Find with:  grep -rl "roxasmayorsoffice-oasys" .
#
#   Contact address .... volunteer@betterroxas.org
#     PLACEHOLDER — no mailbox exists on this domain (the site is deployed on
#     a free vercel.app subdomain, which cannot receive mail).
#     Find with:  grep -rl "volunteer@betterroxas.org" .
#
#   Emergency hotlines and office phone numbers
#     STILL SOLANO'S. Every number under contact/ and services/public-safety
#     is a Nueva Vizcaya number, including the (078) landlines. These were
#     left in place rather than guessed at, and must be replaced with real
#     Roxas City numbers before launch.
#     Find with:  grep -rn "(078)" --include="*.html" .
#
# The Content-Security-Policy in .htaccess and vercel.json allow-lists the
# third-party origins these depend on. If you point them somewhere new, update
# both or the browser will block them.
